      "published_text": "Connect Claude Code to three public research desks:\n\nsh\nclaude mcp add --transport http liquilens https://api.liquilens.in/mcp\nclaude mcp add --transport http seiche https://api.seiche.info/mcp\nclaude mcp add --transport http undertow https://api.seiche.info/undertow/mcp\n\n\nNo API key or local server for the public tools.\n\nTry one question:\n• LiquiLens: What changed in ESAF Small Finance Bank’s NPAs? Show the reporting periods and sources.\n• Seiche: What is the current US funding-stress regime, and what is on the calendar? Cite source dates and coverage limits.\n• Undertow: What is the estimated exit cost for a $100k BTC position? Show venue coverage, timestamps and excluded fees.\n\nFree Claude, Cursor and Codex configs + the combined research skill:\nhttps://liquilens.in/agents/?utm_source=telegram&utm_medium=owned_channel&utm_campaign=mcp_first_use_20261011\n\nTry a cited result in your browser:\nhttps://liquilens.in/start/?utm_source=telegram&utm_medium=owned_channel&utm_campaign=mcp_first_use_20261011\n\nFor a combined review, keep institution, funding and exit evidence separate. Research only; no trade execution.",
